The '''Year of the Witch''' is an [[Event]] that happens every {{Green|12}} [[Time Systems|SkyBlock Years]].

== Mechanics ==
During the '''Year of the Witch''', {{NPCSprite|Agnes}} and {{NPCSprite|Alcina}} appear in the {{zone|Village}} and slain [[Mobs]] drop Ingredients.

=== Ingredients ===
{{About|Year of the Witch ingredients|brewing ingredients|Potions|section=yes}}
During the '''Year of the Witch''', mobs drop Ingredients depending on [[Mob Types|Mob Type]]. Only the player who deals the killing blow to a mob rolls for ingredients. These chances are not affected by {{Ench|Looting}} or {{Ench|Chance}}, only the {{Item|Witch Pet}}'s {{AN|Toil and Trouble}} perk and the {{Attr|Witch's Fortune}} attribute from the {{Item|Sea Witch Shard}}.

Ingredients can be obtained in the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}, and will be put into the Player's Safari Stash. They can be retreieved with the {{Code|/pickupsafaristash}} command. The automatic [[Loot Share]] in the {{Zone|Critter Safari}} does not apply to Ingredients.{{Confirm}} 

